/// M30 HISTORY-059 "T26-native-ai README.md" live-caller roots.
/// Source: tests/baseline/candidates/T26-native-ai/README.md; callers
/// verified by grep over the live tree (code readers plus doc links).
/// Disposition: preserve_record (pins who reads/links the frozen
/// record; no behavior is ported and no execution proof is claimed).
/// Protects (this file): the two live Go readers (path, legs, read
/// needles, kind), the primary guide link (path, line, wording, kind),
/// and the live-code/doc-link tallies.
/// ADAPTATION (recorded, with source lines): t26 pins name
/// tests/baseline/t26_product_guide_test.go (anchor leg L114/L119/L125
/// needle "deferred" L115; slot leg L193/L194/L195 needle "deferr"
/// L200); t27 pins name tests/baseline/t27_release_audit_test.go
/// (slot leg L280/L281/L282 needle "deferr" L282); guide pins name
/// docs/syntax-taste/t26-product-guide-2026-09-24.md (path L394,
/// wording L393); kind pins hold code/doc-reference; tallies hold 2
/// live code readers plus 4 doc links (guide L394, reconciliation L74,
/// proposal L11, audit L18; ledger planning files out of scope).
/// The base record pins live in history-059-base-semantics.can; the run
/// shape plus verdict live in history-059-run-shape.can.
/// Variants: none. Environment: no gates; requires nothing.
/// R/N/S/A identities bind at P23; no live run now. Accept gate is
/// reviewed disposition (no live qualification for preserve_record).
/// Timeout 60000ms is a neutral offline descriptor default.
/// Delegated oracles: none.
/// Execution credit: NOT claimed (preserved history is not execution
/// proof; retirement_eligible false).
/// Case history/readme-record-roots checks: caller-t26-file,
/// caller-t26-anchor-line, caller-t26-slot-line, caller-t26-reads,
/// caller-t26-kind, caller-t27-file, caller-t27-line, caller-t27-reads,
/// caller-t27-kind, doc-guide-file, doc-guide-line, doc-guide-reads,
/// doc-guide-kind, live-code-count, doc-ref-count.
/// Shared old files untouched; retirement is a later integrator decision.
